cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the research note if you use this proof or implementation."
type: article
title: "Uniform bounds for greedy sequences avoiding consecutive sums"
authors:
  - family-names: "Prizmic"
    given-names: "Mark Vladimir"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-11-27
abstract: >-
  Explicit uniform bounds for greedy sequences avoiding sums of r consecutive
  earlier terms, for every fixed r >= 2. The four-term case proves the inequality
  recorded as Conjecture 1 in OEIS A394676. AI-assisted research note with
  reproducible computation. Priority remains unverified.
keywords:
  - greedy sequences
  - complementary sequences
  - integer sequences
  - OEIS A394676
